5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. Let's start by introducing ourselves and sharing our initial thoughts on the situation.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, Jonathan. I am Shizue. I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf among us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I am Asuka. I prefer logic over emotion. Let's focus on identifying the threat efficiently.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi, I'm Kenji! I'm really excited to get started. Let's all share our thoughts and figure this out together!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I am Shion. I observe. Let us see who speaks first and who hides.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shion"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shion: I am Shion. I observe. Let us see who speaks first and who hides.""}]}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I appreciate the introductions. Let's keep our observations brief and focused on the facts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Jonathan. Let us stay calm and listen carefully to each other.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. We need to establish a baseline of behavior. Any sudden shifts in tone or logic will be noted immediately.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Asuka! I’ll keep an eye on everyone’s words. Let’s stay positive and find the truth together!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Agreed. I will remain silent and watch. Let us see who breaks first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I find the tension interesting. Let us not rush to judgment before the night reveals its secrets.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Jonathan. Patience is key. Let us trust the process and support one another through the night.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I concur. Patience is logical. We must wait for the night's outcome before forming any concrete accusations.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I agree with everyone! Let’s stay calm and supportive. I’m ready to help however I can.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Very well. I will observe your patience. Let us see if it holds when the first blood is spilled.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Let us conclude this day. I trust we have established a baseline. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
