31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. The night has passed. Let us begin by sharing our observations from the previous day.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, Jonathan. I am relieved we are all still here. Let us proceed with care and kindness.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Good morning. No deaths reported. I am analyzing the silence. Who among you feels the most pressure to speak now?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Good morning! I’m glad everyone is safe. I have some information from last night that I need to share with you all.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Information? How convenient. Let us hear it, Kenji. I am listening.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shion"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Shion**: Information? How convenient. Let us hear it, Kenji. I am listening.""}]}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am curious about this information. Please share it with us, Kenji.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Please do share, Kenji. We are all listening carefully.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I am listening. Provide the specific name and the result. Vague claims are useless without data.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I checked Shion last night, and he is a werewolf.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Interesting. A bold accusation from a child. I remain calm, but I will watch your next move closely.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find this development... intriguing. Kenji, you are certain of this?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am worried, Kenji. Please be very sure before we make such a serious decision.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Kenji, your claim is specific. Shion, your denial is non-committal. I require a logical rebuttal or I will proceed with the vote.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Asuka: Kenji, your claim is specific. Shion, your denial is non-committal. I require a logical rebuttal or I will proceed with the vote.""}]}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I am certain. My ability never lies. Shion is the werewolf. We must vote him out today to save the village.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"You are mistaken. I am human. Your ""certainty"" is just a child's guess.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I trust Kenji’s certainty. Shion, your calmness is noted, but the evidence points to you. Let us vote.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am so sad, but I believe Kenji. Shion, please tell us the truth.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The evidence is conclusive. Shion is the werewolf. I will vote for his execution immediately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I am certain. Shion is the werewolf. Please vote for him to save the village.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,I accept the vote. I will not beg. Let the village decide if it prefers a child’s word over my silence.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
